<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - P&amp;O,Pearson on Kleinwort list.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - P&amp;O,Pearson on Kleinwort list.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>P&amp;O Plc, the construction-to-cruise liners conglomerate, and media group Pearson Plc were added to Dresdner Kleinwort Benson's list of preferred stocks for 1997, market sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Strategists at the brokerage were not immediately available for comment on reasons for the latest selection.</p>
<p>Kleinwort is rolling out its list of 1997 stock picks two-a-day this week and has already named National Grid Plc, Bass Plc, DFS Furniture Plc, Safeway Plc, TT Group Plc and Johnson Matthey Plc.</p>
<p>Shares in P&amp;O were up 9p at 598-1/2 while Pearson was up 5p at 743-1/2.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
